WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
[Music] A livestream, mid-playtest. Chat: "Hey Phantom, you look tired." "Wait... that looks real." "Did anyone else see that glitch?"

00:05.540 --> 00:07.300
The stream dies.

00:07.380 --> 00:09.200
A Discord server, minutes later: "It's not a crash."

00:09.230 --> 00:12.900
Deadlock — a murder mystery in your browser.

00:12.920 --> 00:14.700
Three acts. Six suspects. One killer.

00:14.770 --> 00:15.680
Inside the machine: deleted logs, still corrupted.

00:15.700 --> 00:16.600
An encrypted channel, waiting for a password.

00:16.620 --> 00:17.520
CCTV footage from 3:47 AM.

00:17.540 --> 00:18.440
Source code with a missing function call.

00:18.460 --> 00:19.360
A memory of the apartment: "I see... myself? Dying."

00:19.390 --> 00:22.130
The suspects: vesp3r_exe, KiaraKills, Ech0_Chamber, ADMIN_NULL, S_89, Dev_Mario.

00:22.150 --> 00:23.980
Phantom, from inside the machine: "Who did this to me?"

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Deadlock. Name the killer. Play at deadlock26.pages.dev.
